{"type": "object", "properties": {"details": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"id": {"type": "string"}, "net": {"type": "integer"}, "tax": {"type": "integer"}, "gross": {"type": "integer"}, "state": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["id", "net", "tax", "gross", "state"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "teams": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"team": {"type": "string"}, "net": {"type": "integer"}, "tax": {"type": "integer"}, "gross": {"type": "integer"}, "gap": {"type": "integer"}}, "required": ["team", "net", "tax", "gross", "gap"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "unmet": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "totals": {"type": "object", "properties": {"net": {"type": "integer"}, "tax": {"type": "integer"}, "gross": {"type": "integer"}}, "required": ["net", "tax", "gross"], "additionalProperties": false}, "report_md": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["details", "teams", "unmet", "totals", "report_md"], "additionalProperties": false}
この内容を前提に、まだ作業を始めず、使う人のイメージと作り方の方針を自然な文章で教えてください。委託用の依頼書やチェックシートへの整形は不要です。未確定の条件は勝手に決めず教えてください。

